DAT
id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
10561::$$$message_0081_0000_0000$$$::"...Man, I'm tired."[lr]::
10562::$$$message_0081_0000_0001$$$::The lights are on at the house. Everyone must be back home by now.[lr]::
10563::$$$message_0081_0000_0002$$$::I walk back home for no reason, but it's pretty cold once the sun sets.[lr]::
10564::$$$message_0081_0000_0003$$$::For now, I should eat dinner, take a bath, and rest my body before I think about what to do[line len=2]::
10565::$$$message_0081_0001_0000$$$::"Shirou, welcome back."[lr]::
10566::$$$message_0081_0001_0001$$$::"Oh hey, Saber. Were you going to go out right now?"[lr]::
10567::$$$message_0081_0001_0002$$$::"No, I was waiting for you to return."[lr]::
10568::$$$message_0081_0001_0003$$$::"..."[lr]::
10569::$$$message_0081_0001_0004$$$::Ah, that explains it. I'm a little taken aback.[lr]::
10570::$$$message_0081_0001_0005$$$::It's kind of an unexpected picture, for her to be so diligently waiting...::
10571::$$$message_0081_0002_0000$$$::"You're the owner of the house. I think it's only right to welcome you back.[lr]::
10572::$$$message_0081_0002_0001$$$::Is it odd to want to show my appreciation for your efforts?"[lr]::
10573::$$$message_0081_0002_0002$$$::"No, you're right about that.[lr]::
10574::$$$message_0081_0002_0003$$$::Thank you. I'm back, Saber."::
10575::$$$message_0081_0003_0000$$$::"Yes, welcome home, Shirou.[lr]::
10576::$$$message_0081_0003_0001$$$::Dinner is ready. Come inside."[lr]::
10577::$$$message_0081_0003_0002$$$::I go through the gate of the Emiya house with Saber.[lr]::
10578::$$$message_0081_0003_0003$$$::As if realizing that things you take for granted are valuable after they end...[lr]::
10579::$$$message_0081_0003_0004$$$::I'll probably look back at this greeting as a special memory sometime.::

